helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\graphic_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156443	1			0	fr	\<variable id=\"graphic_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/graphic_insert.xhp\" name=\"Insertion d'images\"\>Insertion d'images\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
