helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876	11			0	fr	Incorrect, toute variable comprenant un espace devant être placée entre crochets				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147126	14			0	fr	[Mon Numero]=12				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510	15			0	fr	Correct				20130618 17:22:18
