helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020300.xhp	0	help	par_id1196935				0	fr	Sub demoBug				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020300.xhp	0	help	par_id1423993				0	fr	CompatibilityMode( true )				20130618 17:22:18
