helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id9912411				0	fr	Voir \<link href=\"http://wiki.services.openoffice.org/mwiki/index.php?title=Calc/Features/JIS_and_ASC_functions\"\>http://wiki.services.openoffice.org/mwiki/index.php?title=Calc/Features/JIS_and_ASC_functions\</link\> pour une table de conversion.				20130618 17:22:18
