helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2004				0	fr	Le volet \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Styles et Formatage\</item\> contient la fenêtre des \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>        \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Styles et Formatage\</link\>\</caseinline\>        \<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Styles et Formatage\</link\>\</caseinline\>        \<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/05100000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Styles et Formatage\</link\>\</caseinline\>        \<defaultinline\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"styles\"\>Styles et Formatage\</link\>\</defaultinline\>        \</switchinline\>.				20130618 17:22:18
